// Title: Net Conn Dns Tunnel
// Description: Hunts for net conn dns tunnel
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1071.004, T1572
// Severity: low
// FalsePositives:
//   - Koneksi keluar yang sah dari aplikasi enterprise (RMM, monitoring agent).
NetworkConnectionEvents | where DestinationPort == 53 and Protocol == 'UDP' and BytesSent > 10000
